	<AutoArm_EnableMod>启用模组</AutoArm_EnableMod>
	<AutoArm_EnableModDesc>殖民者根据其服装策略自动装备更好的武器。</AutoArm_EnableModDesc>
	<AutoArm_ShowNotifications>显示通知</AutoArm_ShowNotifications>
	<AutoArm_ShowNotificationsDesc>当殖民者装备或升级武器时显示消息。</AutoArm_ShowNotificationsDesc>
	<AutoArm_ShowForcedLabels>显示强制武器标签</AutoArm_ShowForcedLabels>
	<AutoArm_ShowForcedLabelsDesc>为手动分配给殖民者的武器名称添加「强制」标签，并将右键选项标记为强制装备。</AutoArm_ShowForcedLabelsDesc>
	<AutoArm_DisableDuringRaids>突袭期间禁用</AutoArm_DisableDuringRaids>
	<AutoArm_DisableDuringRaidsDesc>在突袭和其他重大威胁期间暂停自动装备。</AutoArm_DisableDuringRaidsDesc>
	<AutoArm_OnlyEquipFromStorage>仅从储存区自动装备</AutoArm_OnlyEquipFromStorage>
	<AutoArm_OnlyEquipFromStorageDesc>殖民者仅从储料堆、货架和其他储存区自动装备武器。忽略地面上的武器。</AutoArm_OnlyEquipFromStorageDesc>
	<AutoArm_UpgradeEquippedWeapons>升级已装备的武器</AutoArm_UpgradeEquippedWeapons>
	<AutoArm_UpgradeEquippedWeaponsDesc>殖民者会在有更好的武器时进行更换。关闭后将停止所有升级，包括副武器升级。空手和空的副武器栏位仍会被填补。</AutoArm_UpgradeEquippedWeaponsDesc>
	<AutoArm_AllowForcedWeaponUpgrades>升级强制武器</AutoArm_AllowForcedWeaponUpgrades>
	<AutoArm_AllowForcedWeaponUpgradesDesc>殖民者可以将强制武器升级为同类型的更高品质版本，例如普通左轮手枪升级为大师级左轮手枪。</AutoArm_AllowForcedWeaponUpgradesDesc>
	<AutoArm_AllowTemporaryColonists>武装临时殖民者</AutoArm_AllowTemporaryColonists>
	<AutoArm_AllowTemporaryColonistsDesc>无装备限制的临时殖民者（难民、借用人员）可以自动装备武器。</AutoArm_AllowTemporaryColonistsDesc>
	<AutoArm_ForceWeapon>将羁绊武器标记为强制</AutoArm_ForceWeapon>
	<AutoArm_ForceWeaponDesc>羁绊的人格武器会自动标记为强制，防止自动切换。</AutoArm_ForceWeaponDesc>

